      "type": "code",
      "text": "from functools import *\n\n@lru_cache(None)\ndef f(n):\n    if n < 3:\n        return 2\n    if n > 2 and n % 2 == 0:\n        return 2 * f(n-2) - f(n-1) + 2\n    if n > 2 and n % 2 != 0:\n        return 2 * f(n-1) + f(n-2) - 2\n\nprint(f(170))"
